rooms_desc ({"Before you stands the entrance to the home of Taws.You stand in the courtyard before Taws house. To your leftyou see a well manicured field, where Taws trains in themartial arts. To the right you see a path leading to thepagoda which serves as a shrine to Taw's God Amaterasu.","This small entranceway leading into Taws humbl abode, isdominated by a fountain which bubbles up in the center of the chamber. The sounds of running water sooth you as youenter. Please be sure to remove your shoes before going intothe house proper!!","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Taw's Courtyard.","The entrance to Taws abode, you marvel at the fountain.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","A brand new room, ready to be decorated",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
